    "ECDSA-sk keys live on hardware tokens such as a YubiKey. iOS cannot enumerate them directly yet; paste the public key line (sk-ecdsa-sha2-nistp256@openssh.com …) under Import.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ECDSA-sk-Schlüssel liegen auf Hardware-Tokens wie einem YubiKey. iOS kann sie noch nicht direkt auslesen; setze die Zeile mit dem öffentlichen Schlüssel (sk-ecdsa-sha2-nistp256@openssh.com …) unter „Importieren“ ein."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las claves ECDSA-sk viven en llaves de hardware como una YubiKey. iOS aún no puede leerlas directamente; pega la línea de la clave pública (sk-ecdsa-sha2-nistp256@openssh.com …) en Importar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les clés ECDSA-sk résident sur des jetons matériels comme une YubiKey. iOS ne peut pas encore les lire directement ; collez la ligne de clé publique (sk-ecdsa-sha2-nistp256@openssh.com …) dans Importer."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ECDSA-sk キーは YubiKey などのハードウェアトークンに保存されます。iOS はまだ直接列挙できません。Import で公開鍵行（sk-ecdsa-sha2-nistp256@openssh.com …）を貼り付けてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ECDSA-sk 키는 YubiKey 같은 하드웨어 토큰에 들어 있습니다. iOS는 아직 이를 직접 읽을 수 없으니, 가져오기에서 공개 키 줄(sk-ecdsa-sha2-nistp256@openssh.com …)을 붙여넣으세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaves ECDSA-sk ficam em tokens de hardware como uma YubiKey. O iOS ainda não consegue lê-las diretamente; cole a linha da chave pública (sk-ecdsa-sha2-nistp256@openssh.com …) em Importar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ECDSA-sk 密钥放在 YubiKey 这类硬件密钥上。iOS 目前读不到它们，请到「导入」里粘贴公钥那一行（sk-ecdsa-sha2-nistp256@openssh.com …）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ECDSA-sk 金鑰放在 YubiKey 這類硬體金鑰上。iOS 目前讀不到它們，請到「匯入」貼上公開金鑰那一行（sk-ecdsa-sha2-nistp256@openssh.com …）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
